      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/King%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1894 the railroad and post office shortened the name to King, eliminating confusion with the original 'King's Cabin'.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/King%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "King sits within the Piedmont Triad, just 15 miles northwest of Winston‑Salem.",
